      "before": "### 3.4 `UnifiedFeaturesV1`",
      "after": "### 3.4 `UnifiedFeaturesV1`\n\n**CSJ-1 prospective Cargo package source comparison kernel.** The exact CONTRACT.md and kernel.json under docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/cargo-source-join-r1/ select the pinned Cargo SourceId kind/CanonicalUrl equivalence PLUS exact precise equality for new-M3 source joins, with nonempty precise fragments required for Git. Lockv4 query encoding and valid URL aliases can differ from metadata serialization. Preserve NKC-1 raw lock tuples and all historical selections; no serialized-source text equality, source equality without revision, tuple normalization or id splitting. Path matching requires an actual admitted path/snapshot witness and null metadata source. A comparison match cannot admit a package, owner or tree; actual manifest/activation/source-slot injectivity, full authenticated producer/profile, source-aware namespaces and provenance-aware failures, library/product/effectiveL/O7/GT/qualification remain open. Four actual synthetic fixture observations and pinned source evidence support the comparison choice only, not native CC2 or product admission.\n"
    }
  ],
